---
title: "xsm: another machine R asked A, then A handed over to B and B to C"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: open
    lg1: Breaks AnswerRecorded
    lg2: Breaks ViewsAgree in some cases
    lg3: Path to the AnswerRecorded or ViewsAgree bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 breaks
  class lg2 mayBreak
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: A holds its place.no question yet
  s1: A handed over to B.R will never accept its answer#59; no question yet
  s2: A handed over to B.R will never accept its answer#59; R waits for an answer
  s3: A handed over to B.R will never accept its answer#59; answer refused
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the person approves#59; M1 has no reason to tell R's machine
  s1 --> s2: R asks A's old address
  s2 --> s2: B answers R
  s2 --> s3: R refuses the answer
